OL,3,Ghttps://bit.ly/heartbeatsoundtracker   
OL,4,Gand https://fb.me/eightbitshed for the 
OL,5,Glatest information                     
OL,7,GKey Features: - 8 SIDs - 24 SID        
OL,8,Gchannels - 7 Ultimate Audio sampler    
OL,9,Gchannels with stereo panning - Load    
OL,10,G16-bit 44.100 Hz mono WAVs from        
OL,11,GmicroSD/USB - 15.6 MB of REU sample    
OL,12,Gmemory - 64 samples & 64 SID           
OL,13,Ginstruments per song - 64 SID          
OL,14,Ginstrument presets always in memory -  
OL,15,G64 patterns of 64 steps each - Linear  
OL,16,Gfrequency table with 64 finetune       
OL,17,Gsteps/semitone (~1.6 cents) - Tempo    
OL,18,Gsetting from 64 to 319 BPM in 1 BPM    
OL,19,Gsteps - 256-step sequencer with        
OL,20,Gtransposing and track mutes - Live     
OL,21,GPlay: Loop a pattern and control the   
OL,22,Gmute switches - Live Play: Queue the   
OL,23,Gnext pattern or a looping region - Name
